smsfw WebUI - third-party components
====================================

This directory ships vendored JavaScript so the WebUI works offline: a device may
have no network, and a WebView must not fetch third-party code at runtime.

  vendor/material-web.min.js
      Material Web Components 2.5.0                    Apache-2.0    (LICENSE-APACHE-2.0)
      Lit 3.3.3, lit-html, @lit/reactive-element       BSD-3-Clause  (LICENSE-BSD-3-CLAUSE)
      Bundled and minified from tools/webui/entry.js with bun; to regenerate run
      tools/webui/build.sh. The bundle is committed so builds need no network.

  tokens.css
      Generated by tools/webui/gen-tokens.mjs using @material/material-color-utilities
      0.4.0 (Apache-2.0). That library is a build-time dependency only and is not
      distributed in this module.

